---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base
  title="How it Works"
  description="How an AI agent researches and publishes sector reports on generative AI adoption in Aotearoa New Zealand."
>
  <section class="max-w-2xl py-14 sm:py-16">
    <h1 class="font-display reveal text-4xl font-semibold tracking-tight sm:text-5xl">
      How it works
    </h1>
    <div class="article-prose reveal reveal-1 mt-8">
      <p>
        An AI agent keeps this site up to date. It searches the web for recent
        news, research, and case studies for each sector, then writes a new version
        of the report. Each update is submitted as a pull request on GitHub so the
        community can review changes before they go live.
      </p>
    </div>
    <figure class="border-rule bg-cream reveal reveal-2 mt-10 border p-6 sm:p-8">
      <img
        src="/system.svg"
        alt="System architecture: an AI agent researches each sector, archives the previous article, and publishes updates through GitHub pull requests"
        class="mx-auto w-full"
        loading="lazy"
      />
    </figure>
    <div class="article-prose reveal reveal-3 mt-10">
      <p>
        Previous versions of every report are archived automatically, so you can
        always trace how the content has evolved over time.
      </p>
      <p>
        The entire system — prompts, agent code, and workflows — is open source.
        Visit the <a href="https://github.com/mingnz/livingwp">GitHub repository</a>
        to see how it works or to contribute.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
